---
const services = [
  {
    title: "Automation & AI",
    description: "Sviluppo e integrazione di assistenti intelligenti e processi automatizzati",
    icon: "cpu"
  },
  {
    title: "Data Analysis & Dashboarding",
    description: "Analisi strategiche e report visivi per decisioni data-driven",
    icon: "bar-chart"
  },
  {
    title: "Software & Web Development",
    description: "Custom software e piattaforme web.",
    icon: "code"
  },
  {
    title: "Digital Innovation & Communication",
    description: "Strategie di marketing e comunicazione basate su dati e creatività",
    icon: "message-circle" 
  }
];
---

<section id="cosa-faccio" class="section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Cosa Faccio</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">DOVE I DATI INCONTRANO LE PERSONE</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="intro-text">
      <p>
        Mi occupo di <strong class="highlight">AI e automazioni</strong>, <strong class="highlight">analisi dei dati</strong> e <strong class="highlight">sviluppo di piattaforme web</strong>, accompagnando le imprese nella loro evoluzione digitale.
      </p>
      <p>
        Aiutare a comprendere e utilizzare il digitale in modo pratico, accessibile e coerente con la loro identità è la mia <strong>MISSIONE</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Coniugo tecnica e visione strategica: Analizzo dati e progetto dashboard per ottenere insight necessari a migliorare la strategia, sviluppo software e creo <strong class="highlight">workflow intelligenti</strong> per migliorare processi e produttività.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      {services.map(service => (
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="icon-box">
             <!-- Placeholder icon logic -->
             <div class="icon-circle"></div>
          </div>
          <h3>{service.title}</h3>
          <p>{service.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="cta-container">
      <a href="#contatti" class="btn btn-primary">Connettiamoci!</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-alt {
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .intro-text {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro-text p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cccccc;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  
  .services-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem; /* Extra space for scrolling past last card */
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .service-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    
    /* Stacking Effect Logic */
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem); 
    /* Each card needs a different top if we want them to stack visibly, 
       but for a simple "deck" effect where they slide over, same top works 
       if the parent has enough height. 
       However, to see the titles of previous ones, we usually offset them.
       Let's try a simple sticky first. */
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); 
  }

  /* Optional: Offset top for each card so they stack like a deck */
  .service-card:nth-child(1) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(2) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 4rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(3) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 6rem); }
  .service-card:nth-child(4) { top: calc(var(--header-height) + 8rem); }

  .service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .icon-box {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .icon-circle {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 92, 0, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  /* Would add SVG icon inside icon-circle */

  .service-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-container {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 100; /* Ensure it stays above sticky cards if needed, though after grid flow it should be fine */
  }
</style>
